# REQUIRED, with no defaults. Docker Compose sets every one of these for the container.
# Running outside Docker, export them in your shell: uvicorn does not read this file.
# A link is a base URL, http://<host>:<port>.
#
# ai-layer: narration, the tool-routing decision of each chat message, and GET /providers
# call it for LLM completions.
# AI_LAYER_URL=
# integration_runner: the pipeline state machine, reached only over HTTP (see
# clients/integration_runner_client.py), never imported as a Python package.
# INTEGRATION_RUNNER_URL=
# The journal: where each run's chat is kept and platforms are purged.
# JOURNAL_URL=
